<title>POLAND: Elektrobudowa revises up '96 net forecast.</title>
<headline>Elektrobudowa revises up '96 net forecast.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish construction company Elektrobudowa SA revised up its 1996 net profit forecast to 13.3 million zlotys from the earlier announced 12.8 million zlotys, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Last year the company made a net profit of 8.4 million zlotys.</p>
<p>Elektrobudowa also revised up its net sales forecast for this year to 214.6 million zlotys, up from the earlier expected 213.0 million.</p>
<p>Last year Elektrobudowa had sales of 168.4 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
